District facility assessment lists Bloomer (Elementary) as a top project: ~$7.8M roof repair + HVAC VRF replacement package; described as a likely future bid once funding is aligned. Primary assessment document and timing are behind the aggregator's sign-up wall (not used). 2020 district Facility Master Plan also flagged Bloomer HVAC/controls.
Contact: Aaron Rang, Director of Facilities Maintenance &amp; Custodial Services (FMCS)
Phone: 712-328-6406
Email: arang@cb-schools.org
Website: https://www.cb-schools.org
Confidence: unconfirmed (aggregator summary of assessment; no bid date yet)
